{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dark and mysterious world of Milkman is yet to be uncovered. A chilling survival horror game that takes place in the beautiful Kellsworth Black Steel hotel. Play as Alanna Kellsworth, arriving at her yearly visit to the hotel to visit her brother in law, only to be shown the dark and nightmarish reality that lurks the hotel corridors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person Survival Horror game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie and dark Kellsworth Hotel avoiding what lurks the hotel hallways.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted monsters await your visit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark and twisted reality of Milkman.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Kellsworth Black Steel Hotel:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome! Your stay at the magnificent Kellsworth hotel, will be one you will never forget, from our beautifully lit hotel lobby to the comfortable room you count sheep in, you will be treated like royalty. Your holiday away is  so good you wish you could stay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163400/extras/f3ebdaf288009f5d80c6e69cb18803ac.poster.avif?t=1769991398\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163400/extras/f3ebdaf288009f5d80c6e69cb18803ac.webm?t=1769991398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163400/extras/f3ebdaf288009f5d80c6e69cb18803ac.mp4?t=1769991398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa